# Audio applications and instrument/effects packages. The graphics product
# keeps the audio runtime (PipeWire, libjack-jackd2-0, osspd) because the
# graphics applications use it for preview audio, but it does not ship a DAW,
# a soft synth, or a guitar rig.
#
# The video front ends are handled by 02-video-optical.list. This batch does
# not remove kdenlive, melt, MLT, subtitleeditor, devede or k3b; that list
# keeps the MLT libraries because Krita and Synfig link them.
ableton-link-utils
ardour
audacity
bespokesynth
carla
csound
dgedit
din
drumgizmo
drumkv1
fmit
freewheeling
gmidimonitor
guitarix
gxtuner
helvum
hydrogen
idjc
jack-mixer
jackd2
jacktrip-gui
jnoise
kid3-qt
kmetronome
lmms
mcpdisp
meterbridge
mixxx
multimedia-puredata
musescore3
padthv1
patchance
polyphone
puredata
qjackctl
qsynth
qtractor
rakarrack
raysession
samplv1
sonic-pi
supercollider
synthv1
ubuntustudio-audio-plugins
vmpk
whysynth
yoshimi
zynaddsubfx
